+| DEC-0002 | Support/browser/device/AT/network matrix and numeric budgets / product+technical owner / before compatibility promise or DM-19 | approved target matrix/budgets | “widely used” is not a claim | GATE-0002; performance informational only |
+| DEC-0003 | Storage API/quota, save window/export/recovery support / technical+product owner / before DM-05 | approved local storage policies | no quota/export promise; preserve safe fallback | GATE-0003 |
+| DEC-0004 | Party/content quantities, balance, locale, audio/remapping, font/contrast / game+experience owner / before DM-04/16 | approved production choices | one bounded campaign only; no numeric/content promise | GATE-0004 |
+| DEC-0005 | Hosting/CDN, cache rollout/rollback, diagnostic transport/retention, support owner / delivery+privacy owner / before DM-17/18/release | approved operating model | local/no-network diagnostics; no host selected | GATE-0005 |
+| DEC-0006 | Identity/sync, multiplayer/safety, live service, IAP/entitlements / product owner / before any related implementation | exclude; or approve scoped service contracts | excluded from P0 | GATE-0006; protects offline campaign |
+| DEC-0007 | Ratings, age, region, legal/store/certification policy / product/legal owner / before distribution claim | applicable approved policy | no certification/legal claim | GATE-0007 |
